      "cooked": "<p>Quick rules summary: Ask any yes/no question, and I can only answer with one of these seven responses:</p><ol>\n<li>Yes</li>\n<li>No</li>\n<li>Yes and No</li>\n<li>Irrelevant</li>\n<li>I don't Know</li>\n<li>Define what you mean by...</li>\n<li>Rephrase Your Question</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Case - Easy</p><p>Wayne lies dead in the water, wearing a plastic raincoat.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Mystery</p><p>Who killed Wayne, how, and why? How did his murderer get caught?</p>",
